~ EndOfDayFiveCutscene
set Player.canMove = false

if (IM.inventory[14] && IM.inventory[15] && IM.inventory[16]):
	Harry: "With these last few ingredients, I complete the final ritual."
	Harry: "..."
	Harry: "I won't get to see the result, and maybe this was all for nothing..."
	Harry: "..."
	Harry: "But if there's even a small chance that you get to live in this world..."
	Harry: "..."
	Harry: "With all of these alchemical recipes completed."
	Harry: "With ingredients drawn from the dead, comprising of experiences only the living can possess."
	Harry: "I transfer my life unto you, my beloved."
	Harry: "My husband..."
	set IM.dayCounter = 6
	do IM.emit_signal("changeItems")
	set Player.canMove = true
else:
	I haven't gathered all of the components for today's recipe yet.
	This is the last step. Just one more recipe and he'll be back...
	set Player.canMove = true

=> END